<section class="platform" id="platform"><div class="shell"><div class="platformhead"><div><span class="eyebrow">The clever enabler</span><h2>Built individually.<br>Better together.</h2></div><p>DARE is the shared publishing and data platform behind the work. Each product has its own audience and purpose. Improvements to the shared foundations can carry across them.</p></div><div class="mechanism"><div><b>D / DATA</b><h3>Start with substance.</h3><p>Bring together source material and information relevant to the audience.</p></div><div><b>A / AI</b><h3>Extend what is possible.</h3><p>Use AI to support the work, with human judgement guiding what is useful.</p></div><div><b>R / RESEARCH</b><h3>Make context count.</h3><p>Interpret information for local needs, cultures and real decisions.</p></div><div><b>E / EXECUTION</b><h3>Put it into practice.</h3><p>Publish, build, monitor and improve. Carry the learning into the next product.</p></div></div></div></section>
